From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: gate built-in copilot actions and menus on the disableAIFeatures
 setting

Flips the built-in `chat.disableAIFeatures` default to true and preconditions every Copilot chat, inline-chat, MCP and SCM action, menu and view on that setting being off, replacing the Copilot extension's `installed` context key so the AI UI stays hidden by default (#2567, #2560, #2563).

